<p>- Iris</p>
<h3>1. unit economics per dozen - value-chain margin per stage</h3>
<p>Anchor: NZ shell egg dozen, retail channel, NZ$ FY26.</p>
<p>Free-range dozen (retails NZ$8.50 at Pak&#x27;nSave / Countdown):</p>
